<title>INDIA: India's 91-day t-bill cut-off unchanged.</title>
<headline>India's 91-day t-bill cut-off unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India said on Friday it maintained the cut-off on the 91-day treasury bill unchanged at 98.0 rupees at its weekly auction.</p>
<p>Dealers said the yield was steady at 8.19 percent.</p>
